ass=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.104</span> </span>, cf.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.21</span> </span>; also, <b class=\"lex-tr\">persuade</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">advise</b> not to do.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.133</span> </span>: an <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> may freq. be supplied, <span class=\"gk\">οὐκ ἐάσει σε τοῦτο</span> will not <b class=\"lex-tr\">allow</b> thee [to do] this, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">538</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κἂν μηδεὶς ἐᾷ</span> even if all men <b class=\"lex-tr\">forbid</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1184</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">444</span> </span>:—so in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">οὐκ ἐᾶσθαι</span>, c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be hindered</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1344</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.142</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.16</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">let alone, let be</b>, c. acc., <span class=\"gk\">ἔα χόλον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.260</s